msgid "Print Wizard"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: printwizard.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The print wizard allows multiple images to be combined into single sheets of "
"paper in standard photo sizes for printing. The combined images can also be "
"automatically opened with the image editor Gimp for enhancement or for direct "
"printing using the Gimp-Print plugin. The combined images can also be output "
"directly to jpeg files."
msgstr ""

